config BR2_PACKAGE_EPASS_TOOLS
	bool "epass-tools"
	help
	  Board-specific diagnostic tools for ePass Next:
	  - cedrus-probe: inspect Cedrus V4L2 formats and buffer layouts
	  - rot-probe: exercise and verify the sun8i-rotate device
	  - vectest: verify and benchmark the xtheadvector (RVV 0.7.1)
	    kernel plumbing and musl string routines on the C906
